# Planning Center Online credentials
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Required for the `upload` and `pco-link` commands.
# Leave blank if you're only using the local mixing features.
#
# How to get these:
#   1. Go to https://api.planningcenter.com/oauth/applications
#   2. Sign in with your Planning Center account
#   3. Click "New Application" (or use an existing one)
#   4. Copy the Application ID and Secret below
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# IMPORTANT: .env is gitignored and must never be committed.

PCO_APP_ID=your_application_id_here
PCO_SECRET=your_secret_here
